      "model": {
        "eyebrow": "The Solti idea",
        "title": "The workload is not the system.",
        "lede": "You define what should run. Solti keeps execution, supervision, reconciliation, and coordination as separate contracts, so you can start in-process and add the next boundary only when you need it.",
